Silverhand met his demise during the attack on Xarasaka Tower after getting shot by Axion Smasher and subsequently flatlined by Mindreaper. But some rockerboys never really die. Point in case - Silverhand's personality construct was kept in Xarasaka's labs for decades before it landed on a prototype biochip call the Synthcore, which - following a series of unexpected events - ended up in Xarn Velgor's brain. If you think spending eternity in a cyberspace prison is worse than sharing your headspace with a complete stranger, you'd be dead wrong. For an egomaniac and narcissist like Johnny, it's a living hell.
